Third-party licenses for Translation LSP

The native server is built from the crates below, including the crates that
only run while it is built. Each entry gives the license the crate declares
and where its source can be downloaded. The texts of the licenses the crates
are used under follow the list.

{{#each crates}}
{{{package.name}}} {{{package.version}}}
  License: {{{license}}}
  Source: https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/{{{package.name}}}/{{{package.version}}}/download
{{/each}}
{{#each licenses}}

========================================================================
{{{name}}} ({{{id}}})

Applies to:
{{#each used_by}}
  {{{crate.name}}} {{{crate.version}}}
{{/each}}
{{#unless source_path}}

No license file was read from the crates above. The text below is the standard
text of the license.
{{/unless}}

{{{text}}}
{{/each}}
